            "desc": "Deposit MBR credits for an account. The payment amount becomes the credit; opening\nthe creditor's credit box is paid out of the deposit itself, so a first deposit nets\namount minus the box MBR \u2014 whoever sends it.",
            "events": [],
            "recommendations": {}
